{"ops":[{"insert":"实例选择器允许用户从不同的数据库实例类型中选择实例，并提供了手动输入功能。组件支持多种数据库类型，如MongoDB、MySQL、Redis等，并且可以根据不同的数据库类型展示不同的配置选项。\n\n交互展示"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"width":"1162"},"insert":{"image":"data:image/png;base64,"}},{"insert":"\n\n主要功能"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"1. **实例选择**：用户可以选择不同类型的数据库实例，如Redis、MongoDB、MySQL等。\n2. **配置管理**：用户可以对选中的实例进行详细配置，包括角色、状态、管控区域等。\n3. **预览结果**：用户可以预览所选实例的结果。\n4. **提交和取消操作**：用户可以提交所选实例并进行确认，或者取消选择并关闭对话框。\n\n使用方法"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"1. **引入组件**：在其他Vue文件中引入该组件。\n2. **使用组件**：在模板中使用该组件，并传入必要的props。\n3. **处理事件**：监听组件的`change`和`cancel`事件，进行相应的处理。\n\nProps"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- `clusterTypes`: 支持的数据库实例类型数组。\n- `tabListConfig`: 可选的标签列表配置。\n- `selected`: 已选中的实例。\n- `unqiuePanelValue`: 是否唯一面板值。\n- `unqiuePanelTips`: 唯一面板提示信息。\n- `hideManualInput`: 是否隐藏手动输入选项。\n- `onlyOneType`: 是否只允许选择一种类型的实例。\n- `disableDialogSubmitMethod`: 禁用对话框提交方法的回调函数。\n\nEmits"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- `change`: 当实例选择发生变化时触发，传递新的选中实例。\n- `cancel`: 当用户取消选择时触发。\n\nSlots"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- `submitTips`: 提交按钮提示信息插槽。\n\nExposes"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- 无直接暴露的属性或方法。\n\n示例代码"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"<template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  <InstanceSelector"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    :clusterTypes=\"['Redis', 'MongoDB', 'MySQL']\""},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    @change=\"handleInstanceChange\""},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    @cancel=\"handleInstanceCancel\" />"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"<script setup>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"import { ref } from 'vue';"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"import InstanceSelector from './path/to/InstanceSelector.vue';"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"const selectedInstances = ref({});"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"const handleInstanceChange = (newSelectedInstances) => {"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  selectedInstances.value = newSelectedInstances;"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  // 处理选中实例的变化"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"};"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"const handleInstanceCancel = () => {"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  // 处理取消操作"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"};"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</script>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"通过上述代码，用户可以在应用中使用`InstanceSelector`组件来选择和管理数据库实例。\n\n扩展组件"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffffff","color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"},"insert":"1. 新组件文件夹"},{"attributes":{"header":2},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffffff","color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"},"insert":"在 components 下新增的新组件文件夹"},{"insert":"\n"},{"insert":{"image":"data:image/png;base64,"}},{"insert":"\n\n"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffffff","color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"},"insert":"2.添加新组件对应的默认配置"},{"attributes":{"header":2},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffffff","color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"},"insert":"参考已有的配置即可："},{"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"width":"550"},"insert":{"image":"data:image/png;base64,"}},{"insert":"\n\n"}]}